    },
    "body": "Apply the requested isolation level to Spanner transactions using `setReadWriteTransactionOptions()` before `begin()`. Previously the isolation level was validated but silently ignored.\n\nAlso corrects `supportedIsolationLevels` to only include levels Spanner actually supports (`REPEATABLE READ` and `SERIALIZABLE`), removing `READ UNCOMMITTED` and `READ COMMITTED`.\n\nBased on #12269.",
